## Project Structure

```text
├── Cargo.toml
├── Dockerfile
├── docker-compose.yml
├── Justfile
├── src/
│   ├── config.rs        # Strongly typed environment configuration
│   ├── error.rs         # Centralized IntoResponse error mapping
│   ├── handlers/        # Axum request handlers
│   ├── middleware/      # Tower middleware layers
│   ├── router.rs        # Route definitions & grouping
│   ├── state.rs         # Shared application state (AppState)
│   ├── lib.rs           # Core application library
│   └── main.rs          # Server entrypoint & graceful shutdown
```
